<title>USA: Alex Brown Inc Q4 net rises 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Alex Brown Inc Q4 net rises 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.51		    $1.39</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.34		     1.23</p>
<p> Net			 37,301		   33,221</p>
<p> Revs		     264,372		  246,665</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	24,641		   23,921</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	28,396		   27,420</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 net rose 12 percent from a year earlier, while earnings per share on both a primary and fully diluted basis rose nine percent.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$6.28		    $4.11</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 5.51		     3.60</p>
<p> Net			154,145		   95,555</p>
<p> Revs		   1,059,421		  809,394</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	24,563		   23,267</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	28,470		   27,192</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share have been adjusted for 3-for-2 stock split effective January 15, 1997.</p>
</text>
